{"id": "3281226", "name": "כלל השרשרת לאורך מסלול במרחב", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 2, "functions": [{"name": "simp0", "params": ["q"], "body": "ratsimp(trigsimp(q))"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>תהא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f:\\mathbb{R}^3\\to\\mathbb{R}\\)</span> פונקציה גזירה, ויהי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(w:\\mathbb{R}\\to\\mathbb{R}^3\\)</span> המסלול</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[\\displaystyle w(t)=(x(t),y(t),z(t))\\]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[\\displaystyle x(t)={{CT:0}}\\]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[\\displaystyle y(t)={{CT:1}}\\]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[\\displaystyle z(t)={{CT:2}}\\]</p><p>נגדיר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(g(t)=f(w(t))=f(x(t),y(t),z(t))\\)</span>. נתבונן בזמן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(t_0={{CT:3}}\\)</span>.</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[\\displaystyle P=w(t_0)={{CT:4}}\\]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[\\displaystyle \\nabla f(P)=({{CT:5}},{{CT:6}},{{CT:7}})\\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">א׳</span>נגזרת המסלול בנקודה</div><p>חשבו את שלוש הנגזרות בנקודה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(t=t_0\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\displaystyle x'({{CT:3}})=\\) [[input:ans2]] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; \\(\\displaystyle y'({{CT:3}})=\\) [[input:ans3]] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; \\(\\displaystyle z'({{CT:3}})=\\) [[input:ans4]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans3]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans4]]</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ב׳</span>כלל השרשרת</div><p>לפי כלל השרשרת,</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[\\displaystyle g'(t_0)=\\nabla f(P)\\cdot w'(t_0) =f_x(P)x'(t_0)+f_y(P)y'(t_0)+f_z(P)z'(t_0) \\]</p><p>חשבו את הערך המבוקש.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\displaystyle g'({{CT:3}})=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\">אין צורך למצוא נוסחה מפורשת עבור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f\\)</span>; כל המידע הדרוש על <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f\\)</span> בנקודה כבר נתון.</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> גוזרים את רכיבי המסלול ומציבים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(t_0\\)</span> (סעיף א׳), ואז מציבים בכלל השרשרת יחד עם הגרדיאנט הנתון בנקודה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(P\\)</span> (סעיף ב׳).</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — נגזרת המסלול (סעיף א׳)</b><br>נחשב תחילה את נגזרת המסלול בזמן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(t_0={{CT:3}}\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[\\displaystyle w'({{CT:3}})= \\bigl(x'({{CT:3}}),y'({{CT:3}}),z'({{CT:3}})\\bigr) =({{CT:8}},{{CT:9}},{{CT:10}}) \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — כלל השרשרת (סעיף ב׳)</b><br>מאחר ש־<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(P=w(t_0)={{CT:4}}\\)</span> ונתון <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\nabla f(P)=({{CT:5}},{{CT:6}},{{CT:7}})\\)</span>, כלל השרשרת נותן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[\\displaystyle g'(t_0)= f_x(P)x'(t_0)+f_y(P)y'(t_0)+f_z(P)z'(t_0) \\]</p>נציב את הנתונים:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[\\displaystyle g'({{CT:3}})={{CT:11}}={{CT:12}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt2]] [[feedback:prt3]] [[feedback:prt4]] [[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "", "prtpartiallycorrect": "", "prtincorrect": "", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 24, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans4", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 0.7, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "tans1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — נכון.</b> כלל השרשרת יושם נכון והתקבל הערך המבוקש של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(g'({{CT:3}})\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — שגוי.</b> הערך הסופי אינו נכון. השתמשו ב־<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(g'(t_0)=f_x(P)x'(t_0)+f_y(P)y'(t_0)+f_z(P)z'(t_0)\\)</span> ובדקו את שלושת ערכי הנגזרות שחישבתם בסעיף הקודם.</div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 0.1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "tans2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — נכון.</b> הערך של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x'({{CT:3}})\\)</span> חושב כראוי.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — שגוי.</b> הערך של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x'({{CT:3}})\\)</span> אינו נכון. גזרו תחילה את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x(t)\\)</span> ורק לאחר מכן הציבו <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(t={{CT:3}}\\)</span>.</div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt3", "value": 0.1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans3", "tans": "tans3", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answern